Greg's suggestion for attacking via -<dir> is quite nice.  I
personally like f<dir> as in rogue.  Recall that rogue would allow you
to fight to the death with just two keystrokes.  Perhaps nethack in
its wondrousness could allow a user-option to permit fighting until
you go below NN% of HP where 1 <= NN <= 100.

Also, when nethack casually mentions "you begin beating monsters with
your bare hands" how about prompting "Are you sure? [yn]".  Obviously
there are some monsters I would like to kill bare-handed in the early
stages of the game.  It would be nice to be prompted each time I
attack a new monster this way.

And as long as I am dreaming, how about a pony?

